@host = http://localhost:5129
@token = COLOQUE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### 1. Login como Admin inicial (criado pelo AdminSeeder em Development)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fogo.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### 2. Registro público (papel Agent)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Agente Silva",
  "email": "silva@fogo.local",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "password": "Silva@12345"
}

### 3. Criar Organização (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CET São Paulo",
  "type": "TrafficAuthority",
  "description": "Companhia de Engenharia de Tráfego"
}

### 4. Criar Endereço (RD-01: bairro + coordenadas obrigatórias)
POST {{host}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Av. Paulista",
  "number": "1000",
  "neighborhood": "Bela Vista",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "zipCode": "01310-100",
  "country": "Brasil",
  "latitude": -23.5649,
  "longitude": -46.6520
}

### 5. Criar Equipamento (TPH Camera)
POST {{host}}/api/equipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Camera",
  "serialNumber": "CAM-PAULISTA-001",
  "brand": "Intelbras",
  "model": "VIP-3230",
  "organizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "addressId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "hasNightVision": true,
  "resolution": "4K",
  "isColor": true
}

### 6. Buscar Equipamentos (RF-04)
GET {{host}}/api/equipments?neighborhood=Bela%20Vista
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Dashboard (RF-03)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Listar Alertas (RF-05)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
